# The API image is built with the REPO ROOT as its build context (see render.yaml's
# `dockerContext: .`), and Docker only ever reads the .dockerignore at the context
# root — `api/.dockerignore` is never consulted for these builds. Without this file a
# local `docker build` would copy a developer's real `api/.env` straight into the
# image alongside the source.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/._*
**/*.log
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
.git
.superpowers
